layout: base.njk
permalink: /about/
title: "About"
description: "The mission, origin, and founders behind The Unknown Now."
heroEyebrow: "About"
heroTitle: "Why we exist"
heroLede: "The Unknown Now started with a simple frustration: good neuroscience research rarely reaches the people it's actually about. We built an organization to close that gap."
missionKicker: "Our mission"
missionHeading: "Science communication first, neuroscience as our lens"
missionBody: "[Placeholder — replace with the org's own words.] We believe credible science shouldn't require a research background to understand. The Unknown Now exists to translate neuroscience and psychology research — the kind that usually stays locked in journals — into writing that's accurate, specific, and genuinely readable. Everything we do, from our published literature reviews to our internship program, is an expression of that one goal."
missionBody2: "We take a foundation-first approach: we'd rather do a small number of things well and honestly than overstate what we've built. If something's still in progress, we say so."
foundersKicker: "Founders"
foundersHeading: "Who runs this"
founders:
  - name: "[Founder Name]"
    bio: "[One or two sentences on their background and role — replace with real bio.]"
  - name: "[Founder Name]"
    bio: "[One or two sentences on their background and role — replace with real bio.]"
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">{{ heroEyebrow }}</p>
    <h1>{{ heroTitle }}</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ heroLede }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
